tags: ["hindi"]
---

{title: Dil Ke Arman Aansuon Men Bah Gaye}
{artist: Salma Agha Ravi}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm]Dil ke armaa [A#]ansuo me [G#]bah gae,        [Cm]Dil ke armaa [A#]ansuo me [Cm]bah gae
[Cm]Ham vafaa kar [Fm]ke bhi tanahaa,        [A#]rah gaee [Cm]ee
[Cm]Dil ke arama [A#]ansuo me [Cm]bah gae,        [Cm]Zindagi ek [D#]pyaas banakar [Cm]rah gai
[Cm]Zindagi ek [D#]pyaas banakar [Cm]rah gai,        [Cm]Pyaar ke qi [A#]sse adhure [G#]rah gae
[Cm]Pyaar ke qi [A#]sse adhure [G#]rah gae,        [Cm]Ham vafaa kar [Fm]ke bhi tanahaa
[A#]rah gaee [Cm]ee,        [Cm]Dil ke arama [A#]ansuo me [Cm]bah gae
[Cm]Shayad unka [D#]akhiri ho [Cm]ye sitam,        [Cm]Shayad unka [D#]akhiri ho [Cm]ye sitam
[Cm]Har sitam ye [A#]sochkar ham [G#]sah gae,        [Cm]Har sitam ye [A#]sochkar ham [Cm]sah gae
[Cm]Ham vafaa kar [Fm]ke bhi tanahaa,        [A#]rah gaee [Cm]ee
[Cm]Dil ke arama [A#]ansuo me [Cm]bah gae,        [Cm]Khudko bhi ham [D#]ne mita da [Cm]la magar
[Cm]Khudko bhi ham [D#]ne mita da [Cm]la magar,        [Cm]Faasle jo dar [A#]miyaan the [G#]rah gae
[Cm]Faasle jo dar [A#]miyaan the [Cm]rah gae,        [Cm]Ham vafaa kar [Fm]ke bhi tanahaa
[A#]rah gaee [Cm]ee,        [Cm]Dil ke arama [A#]ansuo me [Cm]bah gae
